+- `--threshold <metric>=<min>` – gate the CI job by setting a minimum score for a metric (repeatable). Exit 1 if any threshold fails, 0 if all pass. Valid metrics: `exact_match`, `toxicity`, `length_variance`. Values must be between 0 and 1. Reports always include threshold results whether or not any are specified.
 
